      "created_at": "2016-02-07T01:33:03.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Citizen Hammer's character card doesn't specify putting the Position card into play, while Sergeant Steel's (and other similar cards) do.</p><p>Biomancer's description should arguably be Flesh Molder, not Flesh Moulder. (The former is to shape or mold; the latter is to rot.)</p><p>Edit to add: Two extra ones on Greazer's character card.</p><p>a) with respect to the card Living Paycheck, it says \"put it in play area ....\" &nbsp; &nbsp;(missing the word \"the\")</p><p>b) In his advanced text, the word \"themselves\" should be \"themself\" &nbsp;(singular, not plural).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I'll add more if/as I catch them while updating the spoiler sheet.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:46:28.985Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
