      "raw": "<p>Citizen Hammer&#39;s character card doesn&#39;t specify putting the Position card into play, while Sergeant Steel&#39;s (and other similar cards) do.</p><p>Biomancer&#39;s description should arguably be Flesh Molder, not Flesh Moulder. (The former is to shape or mold; the latter is to rot.)</p><p>Edit to add: Two extra ones on Greazer&#39;s character card.</p><p>a) with respect to the card Living Paycheck, it says &quot;put it in play area ....&quot; &nbsp; &nbsp;(missing the word &quot;the&quot;)</p><p>b) In his advanced text, the word &quot;themselves&quot; should be &quot;themself&quot; &nbsp;(singular, not plural).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I&#39;ll add more if/as I catch them while updating the spoiler sheet.</p>",
